    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e902a5373dfd08e351a8f9ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——找那个神鹰的碴？挑战那个在凯旋门赏拿出成绩的家伙？\r\n而且还是在记者面前，让我这未出道的家伙去挑衅她？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b2c396840c764e9287d2e0d2c884a74604913e6a7a6d0f0650f7f30cc2bab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5498094b7948ae739cf9ff61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是在公开场合说出这样的豪言壮语，媒体肯定会紧盯着我们。\r\n从出道战开始的每一步都会备受瞩目，\r\n每一场比赛都会是令人浑身发麻的背水一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04ef87722dbd786f00b1e6fa8a833c97ed1a6a172caa315b2ccd7e28e8449f40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b0d021c978b6a156ac3021",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜则背负全世界的期待，败则承受全世界的嘲笑。\r\n从今往后的每一战，都会吸引所有观众的眼球。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be9091871f91f3ac7a73ad1b043377bb3f039c114f23caeda43346af10fa4151",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49618af9d2b7f25b3d511d8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
