    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:957efd0b44b349335dddad7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈……要真的每天都过着那样的生活，那确实是不燃起来都不行啊。\r\n但要是挑战神鹰的那一战惨败而归的话该怎么做呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c48afe2ab1011017f6548c195305524149cc9180ca790c6d5cfe70f023ba03f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2598f7727ff9df90b9563f0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的赌局里需要“恐惧”这种累赘吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab57b8d3c114d9811dbae0268508ae73eb30b507c2617b49b84c2dc0d94b315f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
