    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2aed23cb886b2874793998",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是自然。对方无论体格和能力都是压倒性地强。\r\n越是拿出全力和她比赛，便越是会因为这实力差而感到绝望。\r\n然而，在那场比赛上——",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba92c9c022087e15f71ac677b501689972f69093341821de42687eac309c884",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a766df8486602f35fb96d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
