        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c55675a280939b67f1533e68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……！……哈哈哈！你居然会这样说啊！\r\n那时候朝你说闲话的——……居然是我自己啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e87009bb04b9a3640b5a5a22466189300619b330bb3dccf6fc7f982dbb26e41a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
