    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:374d0bc94af184191d53a27a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，来赌一把“未来”吧，神鹰。\r\n只要你说OK，剩下的就都由我来安排——\r\n而且得安排在我的出道战之前啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe82d3048e2cb4f15cfad0b2721a3aadda94a717a5be046f098dc6198f38c70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
