      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "二人并肩起跑！赛道状况因昨晚的暴雨而变得相当糟糕！\r\n但这无法阻挡曾与世界一战的“怪鸟”神鹰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd18b28bc09458d38b61c694aea7533cdc21cd99b610b12b0d13407a5fa05ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
