    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8065eb91289d9313d8cec4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（原来如此。不愧是真正挑战过世界的家伙，\r\n集中力和加速力和我都彻底不是一个级别的存在……\r\n硬碰硬可干不掉她啊。）",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee64f319e855b779881f13f68e11d62067e2ba3d49e5cdaaff50953432f0800c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
