    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0cfb3676d5044ce9a79486",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "噢噢～！不愧是神鹰，一边倒啊！\r\n拉开足够的距离后还能稍作减速来保持体力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13dfe2713e7809995bb68781133468296406f17d49fa9e211f4b215fd5ad53b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9cf9b19ca6a70cf925ff732",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次的赛道比较特殊啊。",
