    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5eb46232c94bcdac60a1526",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "快步频跑法的步幅小，倒确实是能依靠多次蹬地来更快地加速，\r\n但相应的体力消耗也很大。\r\n……一般短距离或者沙土跑道才用这个吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93177e26645f1765856cf3021d2c960d516b7a0abd06cb5b71fc8313de0b6ace",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
