      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ce33ffc0d6ab6c22c7da12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……乌合之众的目光也就这么短浅了。这可不是单纯的减速。\r\n好好看看她们的赛道吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a508e7378af2a38b9e8b004fd405a88a507079b70965914c888521f5c5706fc",
