      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎哎！第三・第四弯道的内侧有好大一滩积水！\r\n不过神鹰完全没有踩进去！这就是天命之子的豪运吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f94c0331b3990ca35b33d890a19899b6a8ae01c917496bd10b1775e64d22d1cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
