      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "什么天命啊。她可是拼了老命才避开那区域的。\r\n那滩积水在这种赛道上都算得上是沼泽了，根本就没法从那儿跑。\r\n换句话说——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78023a78574c08b1ccaea59bafb7bdbc17d19b4f44d573e1944f6ed578c4026",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
